{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/8cd6044fc294c27d7678fd19d9bc3a0e.avif?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/d2f0c9f1054005a2485ca6bbcfbc74f0.webp?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/28e1a1667c364dfab0b0934ca5cf6eaf.poster.avif?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/28e1a1667c364dfab0b0934ca5cf6eaf.webm?t=1759140892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse six atmospheric layers: Sand, Mist, Rain, Frost, Clear Skies, and the Stars. Defying gravity as you climb upward, until the tower pierces the heavens and glory reborn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/9cb5e27510033d2e831615f339fee9f3.webp?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1b488841361a2004afe32ccbe5cb9400.poster.avif?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1b488841361a2004afe32ccbe5cb9400.webm?t=1759140892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1b488841361a2004afe32ccbe5cb9400.mp4?t=1759140892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tower layer stores its own supplies. With manpower, pipelines, hot-air balloons, even Stronghands hurling cargo skyward...Weave together a seamless vertical network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/e767fc51333b6d55d56fc27d1bb22f0c.webp?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/cca1d483f59e86c957050e73e05248b2.poster.avif?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/cca1d483f59e86c957050e73e05248b2.webm?t=1759140892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/cca1d483f59e86c957050e73e05248b2.mp4?t=1759140892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinforce the tower with braces to expand outward. Suspended sky gardens, lattice-like aerial platforms, defy gravity for boundless creations in your celestial city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/a44644169b9a0f76416cfe1e1f205642.webp?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/347e74b49f2a23058dbcfc48cc779f29.poster.avif?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/347e74b49f2a23058dbcfc48cc779f29.webm?t=1759140892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/347e74b49f2a23058dbcfc48cc779f29.mp4?t=1759140892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge Ritual Platforms, where the faith of your Towertizens gathers into a force that can summon wind and rain. Fulfill their wishes, and they will gift you their most precious gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/58d5edb39ffe2bf25380de827781a916.webp?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=47 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/45ca95949e8c709f3251fc50c656e96d.poster.avif?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/45ca95949e8c709f3251fc50c656e96d.webm?t=1759140892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/45ca95949e8c709f3251fc50c656e96d.mp4?t=1759140892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the tower ascends, Towertizens will endure trials of faith and disaster. Light Miracle Towers as beacons of hope that bolster morale, efficiency, and pacify the calamities.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Into That Good Night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3209750/84f0dd4e6a53557699d9abd6f140885d1d80b39b.jpg"},{"name":"Endless Rain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstat