ion":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>What's in EA &amp; Join Our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/a0a991019c90611e0646b2e3f7f6c4b9.avif?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=1380 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stay tuned for  news and share your feedback, please follow us on Discord and more:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/882317164e36eac29a52a5948236b57a.avif?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord: Stargate Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitter(X): @STARIO_HavenTow</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reddit:\u00a0r/stariohaventower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TikTok:\u00a0@stario_haventower</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/8cd6044fc294c27d7678fd19d9bc3a0e.avif?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/d2f0c9f1054005a2485ca6bbcfbc74f0.webp?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/28e1a1667c364dfab0b0934ca5cf6eaf.poster.avif?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/28e1a1667c364dfab0b0934ca5cf6eaf.webm?t=1759140892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse six atmospheric layers: Sand, Mist, Rain, Frost, Clear Skies, and the Stars. Defying gravity as you climb upward, until the tower pierces the heavens and glory reborn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/9cb5e27510033d2e831615f339fee9f3.webp?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1b488841361a2004afe32ccbe5cb9400.poster.avif?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1b488841361a2004afe32ccbe5cb9400.webm?t=1759140892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/1b488841361a2004afe32ccbe5cb9400.mp4?t=1759140892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tower layer stores its own supplies. With manpower, pipelines, hot-air balloons, even Stronghands hurling cargo skyward...Weave together a seamless vertical network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209750/extras/e767fc51333b6d55d56fc27d1bb22f0c.webp?t=1759140892\" width=600 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass